structureinfo.railcraft.boiler.0=Railcraft Multiblock Boiler
structureinfo.railcraft.boiler.1=Can use solid or liquid firebox, but cannot mix them in the same boiler structure
structureinfo.railcraft.boiler.2=Can use low pressure or high pressure boiler block, but cannot mix them in the same boiler structure
structureinfo.railcraft.boiler.3=Has multiple valid dimensions, use channel §6width§r and §6height§r to specify it.
structureinfo.railcraft.boiler.4=Width range: 1-3. Height range: depends on width, but in general 1-4.
structureinfo.railcraft.boiler.5=Uses sub channel §6boiler§r§7 to specify what type of boiler to use. 
structureinfo.railcraft.boiler.error.invalid_dimension=Width %s Height %s is not a valid combination.

